From 31f886f92066833bb302a4611362e8acaf91f20d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Huixiaqing Liu <huixiaqingliu@outlook.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 08:43:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 5/8] Restore K50 MT6353 ISINK flash and serialize timeout
 teardown

Use the stock ISINK0/1 register sequence and fixed current settings in place of the unconnected RT4505. Propagate PMIC and open failures, publish callbacks only after successful initialization, and drain timer/work before off, release or rearm. Exercise the actual driver and selector with PMIC faults and queued/running timeout work.
